WEBVTT

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:30.136
but we are expanding it to the world,

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:35.296
making archaeological exploration
more open, inclusive,

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:38.240
and at a scale simply
not previously possible.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:42.016
This is why I am so excited

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:44.136
to share with you all today

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:49.416
that we will begin
the 2016 TED Prize platform

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:50.720
in Latin America,

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:54.400
more specifically Peru.

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:56.256
(Applause)

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:57.640
Thank you.